WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:14.411
and Bajie flew away from the jail quickly.

2
00:00:15.471 --> 00:00:18.413
They left Metro City and were soon drifting high above the mountains.

3
00:00:21.215 --> 00:00:22.655
They landed in an open meadow.

4
00:00:26.778 --> 00:00:30.540
Wukong," Bajie said, "I'm glad you found me.

5
00:00:31.424 --> 00:00:34.065
I was afraid I'd be stuck alone in this world."

6
00:00:34.085 --> 00:00:37.867
"It's good to see you, Bajie," Wukong said.

7
00:00:37.887 --> 00:00:41.689
"I need a nap," Bajie said, lying down.

8
00:00:41.709 --> 00:00:44.290
"Then we should return to Master."

9
00:00:49.372 --> 00:00:50.433
you notice anything odd?"

10
00:00:50.753 --> 00:00:53.494
Wukong asked, looking around at the meadow and mountains.

11
00:00:54.975 --> 00:00:57.836
"Not really," Bajie said and closed his eyes.

12
00:00:59.248 --> 00:01:03.432
"These mountains resemble the mountains we're traveling through with Master," Wukong said.

13
00:01:03.452 --> 00:01:08.776
"But there's one big difference—there are no demons here."

14
00:01:08.796 --> 00:01:11.058
"How do you know that?"

15
00:01:11.398 --> 00:01:12.739
Bajie asked with a snort.

16
00:01:12.759 --> 00:01:18.203
"I can see really far, and I can sense demons," Wukong said.

17
00:01:18.223 --> 00:01:21.726
"I just realized I haven't sensed any demons since I arrived.

18
00:01:23.007 --> 00:01:24.669
Maybe we should stay here for a little while."

19
00:01:24.689 --> 00:01:28.772
"I don't like this world," Bajie said, scowling.

20
00:01:30.329 --> 00:01:32.231
"They put me in jail, and for what?

21
00:01:32.851 --> 00:01:35.313
Because I ate a little bit of food—bah!"

22
00:01:37.655 --> 00:01:38.996
Wukong tapped his chin.

23
00:01:39.016 --> 00:01:41.158
"What if we take over this place?

24
00:01:41.818 --> 00:01:43.720
That way they can't put you back in jail.

25
00:01:44.501 --> 00:01:46.202
And we'll get a break from fighting demons."

26
00:01:46.222 --> 00:01:53.308
"I like that idea, but there's one person here who's pretty powerful."

27
00:01:54.809 --> 00:01:56.090
Wukong raised an eyebrow.

28
00:01:56.110 --> 00:01:58.332
"Do you mean Rocket Girl?"

29
00:01:59.584 --> 00:02:00.225
"Did you meet her?"

30
00:02:00.525 --> 00:02:01.365
Bajie asked.

31
00:02:02.186 --> 00:02:02.987
Wukong nodded.

32
00:02:03.007 --> 00:02:08.430
"She's powerful, but she's not here anymore—I sent her to our world."

33
00:02:08.450 --> 00:02:11.333
"Good work!"

34
00:02:12.113 --> 00:02:13.274
Bajie said with a laugh.

35
00:02:13.294 --> 00:02:15.816
"So let's take over this place.

36
00:02:18.057 --> 00:02:22.781
We'll boss everyone around and eat all their food."

37
00:02:22.801 --> 00:02:27.024
"We're going to need an army to take over the kingdom," Wukong said thoughtfully.

38
00:02:28.028 --> 00:02:32.211
"I'll make a quick trip back to the Fruit and Flower Mountain."

39
00:02:33.412 --> 00:02:34.053
"Watch this."

40
00:02:35.013 --> 00:02:38.796
Jack jumped off his sofa and started spinning around, kicking and throwing punches.

41
00:02:38.816 --> 00:02:40.978
"I'm the monkey!"

42
00:02:42.179 --> 00:02:43.359
Mara laughed and snorted.

43
00:02:47.002 --> 00:02:48.783
at me—I'm the pig!"

44
00:02:51.285 --> 00:02:52.466
She let out a big burp.

45
00:02:57.152 --> 00:02:59.853
While Jack and Mara laughed, Terrell sneaked out of the room.

46
00:03:03.334 --> 00:03:06.315
He pulled out his phone and called Roxy, but she still didn't answer.

47
00:03:06.335 --> 00:03:09.676
"Where is she?"

48
00:03:11.376 --> 00:03:12.796
Terrell wondered with a sigh.

49
00:03:12.816 --> 00:03:15.617
"And why won't she answer my calls?"

50
00:03:17.858 --> 00:03:19.898
"Open up this door, Demon!"

51
00:03:20.198 --> 00:03:20.939
Roxy shouted.

52
00:03:21.979 --> 00:03:25.580
She punched and kicked the cave's door, yelling all sorts of terrible things.

53
00:03:26.464 --> 00:03:28.846
Finally the Demon of Black Rain opened the door.

54
00:03:28.866 --> 00:03:32.689
"Why are you still here?"

55
00:03:32.709 --> 00:03:36.372
"Release those prisoners right now!"

56
00:03:36.833 --> 00:03:38.314
Roxy yelled, stamping her foot.

57
00:03:38.334 --> 00:03:42.777
"No!" The demon glared at Roxy.

58
00:03:43.578 --> 00:03:45.339
"You're a rude person!

59
00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:50.484
I'm trying to rest, and you're banging on my door and yelling mean things!"

60
00:03:51.885 --> 00:03:55.448
Whiz-hoo! Roxy's eye laser beams zapped the demon's face.

61
00:03:56.212 --> 00:03:59.215
"Ouch!" The demon threw a punch.

62
00:04:00.596 --> 00:04:01.877
Roxy leaped out of the way.

63
00:04:01.897 --> 00:04:05.600
"Ha! You missed—" Whoosh!

64
00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:08.362
Wind and rain swept Roxy away again.

65
00:04:10.203 --> 00:04:13.306
She tumbled down the side of the mountain, crashing through shrubs.

66
00:04:14.587 --> 00:04:16.488
Finally she landed at the bottom of the mountain.

67
00:04:18.090 --> 00:04:20.692
Up above, the cave's door slammed shut.

68
00:04:28.292 --> 00:04:30.177
"Grr!" Roxy was about to fly back up the mountain.

69
00:04:31.360 --> 00:04:32.984
Suddenly an old woman appeared.

70
00:04:33.005 --> 00:04:35.471
"Don't go back up there!"
